{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002430/extras/9dc835dc38ba5b197068164b12fb3644.avif?t=1760337663\" width=780 height=165 /></span><br>Hit the streets in this arcade demo of Taxi Chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and dive into fast-paced, no-rules taxi action in a neon-lit city buzzing with chaos. The demo puts you straight into Arcade Mode, where every second counts and every fare has a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one vehicle from each class, each with its own handling and feel, and test out a selection of special abilities built for boosting, dodging, smashing, and scoring big. From slippery corners to sudden hazards and unpredictable routes, the streets won\u2019t go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts around 20 to 25 minutes, packed with dynamic world events, shifting routes, and wild customers that demand more than just speed. Think you\u2019ve mastered the city? Get ready for TaxiBot rivals who won\u2019t hesitate to block, ram, or send your cab flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002430/extras/b503e7f28d20f4ddc2b825dee669d0d4.avif?t=1760337663\" width=780 height=165 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 to 4 escalating levels of difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One vehicle per class</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rotating mix of high-demand customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route blockers, hazards, orbital strikes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising TaxiBot competition, from simple rivals to aggressive rammers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No customization or unlocks, just raw arcade chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This demo is an early slice of the game and does not represent the final version. Content, visuals, and gameplay systems are subject to change.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002430?t=1760337663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002430?t=1760337663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002430/a27af9c5a60b16a589eea173fee8a02169fb1817/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760337663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002430/a27af9c5a60b16a589eea173fee8a02169fb1817/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760337663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002430/extras/9dc835dc38ba5b197068164b12fb3644.avif?t=1760337663\" width=780 height=165 /></span><br>Hit the streets in this arcade demo of Taxi Chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and dive into fast-paced, no-rules taxi action in a neon-lit city buzzing with chaos. The demo puts you straight into Arcade Mode, where every second counts and every fare has a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one vehicle from each class, each with its own handling and feel, and test out a selection of special abilities built for boosting, dodging, smashing, and scoring big. From slippery corners to sudden hazards and unpredictable routes, the streets won\u2019t go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts around 20 to 25 minutes, packed with dynamic world events, shifting routes, and wild customers that demand more than